# UI Generation Guidelines

This rule provides comprehensive guidelines for generating UI components using MCP (Model Context Protocol) or when creating new Flutter UI elements in the Meup project.

## Core Principles
- Follow established design system patterns and components
- Maintain consistency across the application
- Use predefined utilities and components before creating new ones
- Ensure proper spacing, typography, and color usage

## Component Guidelines

### Text Components
Use `AppText` from [lib/core/utils/text/d_text.dart](mdc:lib/core/utils/text/d_text.dart) for all text elements:

```dart
// Standard text usage
AppText(
  'Your text content',
  style: AppStyle.textMedium16,
)

// With custom properties
AppText(
  'Custom text',
  style: AppStyle.textBold20,
  color: CustomColor.primary,
  textAlign: TextAlign.center,
)
```

### Text Styles
Use predefined styles from `AppStyle` in [lib/config/themes/text_theme.dart](mdc:lib/config/themes/text_theme.dart):

```dart
// Common text styles
AppStyle.textRegular14    // Regular 14px
AppStyle.textMedium16     // Medium 16px
AppStyle.textBold18       // Bold 18px
AppStyle.textSemiBold20   // SemiBold 20px

// Apply styles to AppText
AppText(
  'Heading Text',
  style: AppStyle.textBold24,
)
```

### Color Usage
Check existing colors in `CustomColor` from [lib/config/themes/colors.dart](mdc:lib/config/themes/colors.dart) before adding new ones:

```dart
// Use existing colors
Container(
  color: CustomColor.primary,
  child: AppText(
    'Colored text',
    style: AppStyle.textMedium16.copyWith(
      color: CustomColor.onPrimary,
    ),
  ),
)

// If color doesn't exist, add to CustomColor class:
// static const Color ff497BEE = Color(0xFF497BEE);
// static const Color primaryBlue = Color(0xFF497BEE);
```

### Spacing and Sizing
Use `ScreenUtil` for responsive spacing and sizing (already imported):

```dart
// Spacing
EdgeInsets.all(16.w)           // 16 logical pixels width-based
EdgeInsets.symmetric(
  horizontal: 20.w,            // Horizontal spacing
  vertical: 12.h,              // Vertical spacing
)

// Sizing
Container(
  width: 200.w,                // Responsive width
  height: 100.h,               // Responsive height
  child: widget,
)

// Font sizes (when not using AppStyle)
fontSize: 16.sp,               // Responsive font size
```

### Image Components

#### Network/Cached Images (PNG, JPG, JPEG)
Use `DCachedImage` from [lib/core/utils/images/cache_image.dart](mdc:lib/core/utils/images/cache_image.dart):

```dart
// Basic cached image
DCachedImage(
  url: imageUrl,
  width: 100.w,
  height: 100.h,
  fit: BoxFit.cover,
)

// With additional properties
DCachedImage(
  url: imageUrl,
  width: 200.w,
  height: 150.h,
  borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(12.r),
  enablePhotoView: true,
  onTap: () => handleImageTap(),
)
```

#### SVG Images
Use `SvgPicture.asset` for SVG images:

```dart
// Basic SVG usage
SvgPicture.asset(
  AppAssets.svg.app.icHome,
  width: 24.w,
  height: 24.h,
)

// With color customization
SvgPicture.asset(
  AppAssets.svg.app.icProfile,
  width: 20.w,
  height: 20.h,
  colorFilter: ColorFilter.mode(
    CustomColor.primary,
    BlendMode.srcIn,
  ),
)
```

#### Asset References
Get all assets from `AppAssets` in [lib/core/constants/gen/assets.gen.dart](mdc:lib/core/constants/gen/assets.gen.dart):

```dart
// Images
AppAssets.images.backgroundPng
AppAssets.images.logoJpg

// Icons
AppAssets.icons.bookPng
AppAssets.icons.cupPng

// SVG icons
AppAssets.svg.app.icHome
AppAssets.svg.app.icProfile
AppAssets.svg.common.success
```

### Localization
Use existing localized strings with `context.text.key`:

```dart
// For existing text strings
AppText(
  context.text.welcomeMessage,
  style: AppStyle.textMedium16,
)

// Button with localized text
ElevatedButton(
  onPressed: () {},
  child: AppText(
    context.text.continueButton,
    style: AppStyle.textSemiBold16,
  ),
)
```

## Layout Guidelines

### Common Layout Patterns
```dart
// Standard page layout
Scaffold(
  appBar: AppBar(
    title: AppText(
      context.text.pageTitle,
      style: AppStyle.textBold18,
    ),
  ),
  body: Padding(
    padding: EdgeInsets.all(16.w),
    child: Column(
      crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
      children: [
        // Page content
      ],
    ),
  ),
)

// Card-based content
Container(
  margin: EdgeInsets.all(12.w),
  padding: EdgeInsets.all(16.w),
  decoration: BoxDecoration(
    color: CustomColor.surface,
    borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(12.r),
    boxShadow: [
      BoxShadow(
        color: CustomColor.shadow,
        blurRadius: 8.r,
        offset: Offset(0, 2.h),
      ),
    ],
  ),
  child: Column(
    children: [
      // Card content
    ],
  ),
)
```

### Button Components
Use `AppButton` from [lib/core/utils/button/app_button.dart](mdc:lib/core/utils/button/app_button.dart) for all button elements:

```dart
// Primary button
AppButton.primary(
  onPressed: handleButtonPress,
  child: 'Submit',
)

// Primary button with full width
AppButton.primary(
  onPressed: handleButtonPress,
  fullWidthBtn: true,
  child: 'Continue',
)

// Primary button with icon
AppButton.primaryWithIcon(
  onPressed: handleButtonPress,
  icon: AppAssets.svg.app.icArrowRight,
  child: 'Next Step',
)

// Secondary button
AppButton.secondary(
  onPressed: handleButtonPress,
  child: 'Cancel',
)

// Secondary button with icon
AppButton.secondaryWithIcon(
  onPressed: handleButtonPress,
  icon: AppAssets.svg.app.icEdit,
  child: 'Edit Profile',
)

// Disabled button
AppButton.primary(
  onPressed: null,
  disabled: true,
  child: 'Disabled Button',
)

// Custom button with additional properties
AppButton.primary(
  onPressed: handleButtonPress,
  padding: EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 32.w, vertical: 20.h),
  borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(12.r),
  height: 56.h,
  child: 'Custom Button',
)

// Button with Widget child (for complex content)
AppButton.primary(
  onPressed: handleButtonPress,
  child: Row(
    mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
    children: [
      Icon(Icons.star, size: 16.r),
      SizedBox(width: 8.w),
      AppText('Rate Now', style: AppStyle.textBold16),
    ],
  ),
)
```

## Implementation Checklist

When generating UI components, ensure:

- [ ] Use `AppText` for all text elements
- [ ] Apply `AppStyle` for text styling
- [ ] Check `CustomColor` for existing colors before adding new ones
- [ ] Use `ScreenUtil` for responsive sizing (`.w`, `.h`, `.sp`, `.r`)
- [ ] Reference assets through `AppAssets`
- [ ] Use `DCachedImage` for raster images
- [ ] Use `SvgPicture.asset` for SVG images
- [ ] Use `context.text.key` for localized strings
- [ ] Follow consistent spacing and layout patterns
- [ ] Ensure accessibility and responsive design

